		{
			dependencies: ["70C952B8FF3418F6"]
			description: [
				"Finally, at &6HV&r you get access to the &dByproducts&r"
				""
				"These byproducts are often incredibly useful and will come in handy multiple times as you progress"
				"The custom ore-enhancement branch is an optional alternative alongside standard GregTech refining. An HV Arc Furnace converts one Ore Shard and 144 mB Blazing Pyrotheum into one Ore Crystal (480 EU/t). A furnace converts that Crystal into eight Clusters."
				"For a further upgrade, an HV Chemical Bath converts one Crystal and 10 mB UU-Matter into one Ore Clump (480 EU/t). A furnace converts the Clump into sixteen Clusters. Fluid availability can delay this beyond simply owning an HV machine."
				"For iron, copper and gold, Blood Magic also provides an HV Chemical Reactor alternative: one Shard, one Blood Chemical Catalyst and 1,000 mB water produce one Crystal. Choose a useful route in JEI; these optional conversions do not replace progression gates."
			]
